e-ws1514496","paragraph_id":"c-chenshu-023-shenjunli-complete:p005","quote":"君理第五弟叔邁，亦方正有幹局，仕梁為尚書金部郎。永定中，累遷中書侍郎。天嘉中，歷太僕、廷尉，出為鎮東始興王長史、會稽郡丞，行東揚州事。光大元年，除尚書吏部郎。太建元年，遷為通直散騎常侍，侍東宮。二年卒，時年五十二。贈散騎常侍。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-chenshu-023-shenjunli-complete:p005:m0005","object_person_mention_id":"c-chenshu-023-shenjunli-complete:p005:m0000","source_term":"君理第五弟叔邁","source_assertion_id":"a-chen023-shumai-brother"},{"work_id":"w-chenshu","book_id":"b-chenshu-023","chapter_id":"c-chenshu-023-shenjunli-complete","source_id":"s-chenshu-023-shenjunli-complete-ws1514496","paragraph_id":"c-chenshu-023-shenjunli-complete:p001","quote":"沈君理字仲倫，吳興人也。祖僧畟，梁左民尚書。父巡，素與高祖相善，梁太清中為東陽太守。侯景平後，元帝徵為少府卿。荊州陷，蕭詧署金紫光祿大夫。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-chenshu-023-shenjunli-complete:p001:m0000","object_person_mention_id":"c-chenshu-023-shenjunli-complete:p001:m0023","source_term":"父巡","source_assertion_id":"a-chen023-junli-father"}],"status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"interpretation_note":"依本傳兄弟明文與君理父巡兩則原句暫接父系。"}}],"source_mention_summary":[{"source_id":"s-chenshu-023-shenjunli-complete-ws1514496","work_id":"w-chenshu","book_id":"b-chenshu-023","chapter_id":"c-chenshu-023-shenjunli-complete","raw_mention_count":1,"mention_ids":["c-chenshu-023-shenjunli-complete:p005:m0005"],"paragraph_ids":["c-chenshu-023-shenjunli-complete:p005"],"table_cell_ids":[],"occurrence_groups":[{"canonical_mention_id":"c-chenshu-023-shenjunli-complete:p005:m0005","mention_ids":["c-chenshu-023-shenjunli-complete:p005:m0005"],"kind":"paragraph"}],"mention_count":1,"duplicate_mention_count":0,"paragraph_occurrence_count":1,"table_occurrence_count":0,"passage_count":1,"passage_count_scope":"annotation_containers_not_independent_witness_passages","count_explanation":"1處獨立位置，1個原始錨點；0項為同底本同位置重出。頻次不是來源權威度。"}],"most_mentioned_source_ids":["s-chenshu-023-shenjunli-complete-ws1514496"],"mention_count_policy":{"scope":"independent_fixed_witness_occurrences","raw_mentions_preserved":true,"passage_count_scope":